Big-FISH and Spotiflow
----------------------

Big-FISH (classical spot detection) and Spotiflow (AI spot detection, optional) are separate projects by
their own authors. This project uses them as dependencies. Using them here does not mean that their authors
endorse PoCo / Polony Review.

The fine-tuned model shipped as a release asset was fine-tuned from the pretrained Spotiflow "general" model.
Spotiflow's BSD-3-Clause notice (Copyright (c) 2023, Albert Dominguez Mantes, Martin Weigert) is distributed with it
(`LICENSE-spotiflow.txt` in the model release). The pretrained weights have no separate licence statement; see
MODEL_CARD.md for that open point.
